## Requirement 1: Credential Vault

### 1.1 Vault File Format

The vault is stored as a single encrypted file at `~/.ai_agent/vault.enc`:

```json
{
  "version": 2,
  "kdf": {
    "algorithm": "argon2id",
    "iterations": 3,
    "memory_kb": 65536,
    "parallelism": 4,
    "salt": "<base64-encoded-32-bytes>"
  },
  "encrypted_payload": {
    "ciphertext": "<base64-encoded>",
    "nonce": "<base64-encoded-12-bytes>",
    "tag": "<base64-encoded-16-bytes>"
  },
  "metadata": {
    "created_at": "2024-01-15T10:30:00Z",
    "last_modified": "2024-01-20T14:22:00Z",
    "secret_count": 12
  }
}
```

**Decrypted Payload Structure (JSON):**

```json
{
  "secrets": {
    "openai_api_key": {
      "type": "api_key",
      "value": "sk-proj-...",
      "created_at": "2024-01-15T10:30:00Z",
      "rotated_at": null,
      "metadata": {
        "service": "openai",
        "environment": "production"
      }
    },
    "github_oauth": {
      "type": "oauth_token",
      "value": {
